| Crafter | `bash dev_examples/crafter/run_fresh_gepa.sh` | `crafter_gepa_sdk_20260531043041` | `dev_examples/crafter/runs/crafter_gepa_sdk_20260531043041/` | **Pass** | train 0.667 / heldout 0.333 | in-process `Container.serve()` | async |
